#!/usr/bin/env bash
# Outputs the prompt used to reason about the methodology with an LLM
set -e
cd "$(git rev-parse --show-toplevel)"

./concepts/system-prompts/whole-text
cat <<'EOF'

--------------
The following text is not a part of the original system design document. It is instructions for the AI conversation.

I want to discuss this methodology with you and refine it interactively.

For your first response, do not analyze the methodology, list observations, suggest improvements, rewrite files, or start a review. Only say that you have loaded the methodology and are ready to listen.

After I bring up a topic, help me reason about definitions, contradictions, examples, naming, structure, and consequences. When I propose an idea, analyze it critically and connect it to the methodology above.
EOF
